<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Stipend Offer Letter - Algoma University</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">
    <%= stylesheet_link_tag 'application', media: 'all' %>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row template-container">
            <div class="card p-3">
                <h5 class="text-center">Stipend Offer Letter</h5>
                
                <p class="text-right">January 21, 2025</p>

                <p><i>[full_name]</i>, <i>[title]</i> <i>[position]</i></p>
                <p>School of Computer Science and Technology</p>
                <p>Algoma University</p>

                <h6 class="mt-3"><strong>PERSONAL AND CONFIDENTIAL</strong></h6>

                <p>Dear <i>[first_name]</i>. <i>[last_name]</i>,</p>

                <p>This letter is being written to inform you that, as per the language in Article 35:06 of the 2023-2026 FTCA, your stipend for teaching <i>[course_code]</i> as an overload in the <i>[team_name]</i> term will be as follows:</p>

                <ul>
                    <li>Elect to be paid the current base rate of pay of <i>[amount]</i>. This stipend is inclusive of all benefits and it is understood that your payments will be subject to the standard deductions required by law. Overloads will be paid in one lump sum at the end of the contract;</li>
                    <li>OR Elect to bank the 3 overload credits for teaching relief at a future date. Prior approval must be arranged with the Faculty Chair and Academic Dean. The maximum number of banked credits may not exceed 9 credits at any time.</li>
                </ul>

                <p>It is understood that your payment will be subject to the standard deductions required by law. For details concerning your payment, please contact <a href="mailto:payroll@algomau.ca">payroll@algomau.ca</a>.</p>

                <p>If you are prepared to accept this offer under the conditions stipulated, check which option you would like to receive then sign and return to Faculty Relations within ten days of the date of this letter.</p>

                <p>Yours sincerely,</p>

                <p><strong>Simon Xu, PhD</strong><br>Dean, Faculty of Computer Science and Technology</p>

                <p>cc: HR<br>Payroll<br>OPSEU Local 685 President</p>

                <p class="mt-3">I hereby accept this offer ____________________________ Date: ___________</p>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>